==Battleground==
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*30 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
*15 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The best way to beat this stage is to stack up a bunch of attackers on the two Metal Hippoes to wail on the enemies from a safe distance. The B.B.Bunnies at the beginning can also be treated as free money. Make sure that any lineup used is also capable of beating the continuation stage, [[Miracle Iris (Deadly)|Miracle Iris]].

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*Meatshields (e.g. [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]): Meatshields are important on almost every stage and this is no exception.
*Long Distance units (e.g. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]], [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]]): Long Distance attackers are key for this stage because they can use the Metal Hippoes to attack the enemies from a safe distance. They are not as effective on Miracle Iris because of the many quick enemies, such as Gory Dark, Angelic Gory and Li'l Bun Bun and the Metal One Horn which can push into their blind spots.
*General attackers (e.g. [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]): They won't be as effective on this stage, but on Miracle Iris they do a lot better because of their lack of blind spot.
*Critical Hitters (e.g. [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]], [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]]): While it's recommended to leave the Metal Hippoes alive on this stage, in Miracle Iris there is a Metal One Horn, which will be almost impossible to kill without critters.

